    page("newsletter/", "Daily Defence Brief — Newsletter", "Top stories, exam alerts and defence contracts every morning. Free.", f'''<div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="{R()}">Home</a> › Newsletter</div><div class="center" style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto"><span class="eyebrow">Free daily email</span><h1>Daily Defence Brief</h1><p class="muted">Five stories, one exam alert, one contract, one chart — read in three minutes. Sent 7am IST.</p></div>{newsletter_block()}<div class="container center"><p class="small muted">Prefer WhatsApp or Telegram? <a data-link="whatsappChannel" href="#">Join the WhatsApp channel</a> · <a data-link="telegram" href="#">Telegram</a></p></div></div>''')
    page("about/", "About DefenceIndia.com", "Independent defence news, careers guidance and industry intelligence for India — who we are, what we cover and how we are funded.", f'''<div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="{R()}">Home</a> › About</div><div class="prose"><h1>About DefenceIndia.com</h1><p>DefenceIndia.com is an independent media and information platform covering India's armed forces, defence careers and the defence industry. We serve three communities that rarely get one home: the millions of young Indians preparing for uniformed careers, the serving and veteran community, and the companies building Make in India in defence.</p><h2>What we do</h2><ul><li>Explainers and analysis on the services, procurement, reform and the military balance.</li><li>A careers hub with every entry route, live tools and free counselling.</li><li>An equipment database and comparison tools.</li><li>Industry intelligence — directory, procurement tracker and start-up coverage.</li></ul><h2>How we are funded</h2><p>Advertising (including Google AdSense), sponsored content that is always labelled, lead-generation partnerships with coaching institutes and industry, affiliate links, reader support and contest sponsorships. Editorial coverage is never for sale. See our <a href="{R('editorial-policy/')}">editorial policy</a>.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>We are not affiliated with the Ministry of Defence, any armed force, or any government body. We do not publish classified or restricted information and we respect operational security. See the <a href="{R('disclaimer/')}">disclaimer</a>.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Editorial, corrections and general enquiries: <a href="{R('contact/')}">contact page</a>. Website, domain, sponsorship, advertising or partnership: <a href="{CONTACT_URL}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">web.works/contact</a>.</p></div></div>''')
    page("contact/", "Contact", "Contact DefenceIndia.com — editorial, corrections, tips, advertising, partnerships and general enquiries.", f'''<div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="{R()}">Home</a> › Contact</div><div class="layout"><div class="form"><h1 style="font-size:1.6rem">Contact us</h1><p class="sub">Every message reaches the editorial desk. For website / domain / sponsorship / advertising / partnership, use <a href="{CONTACT_URL}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">web.works/contact</a>.</p><form data-di-form="Contact" data-success="Message sent — we usually reply within 2 business days."><div class="field-row"><div class="field"><label>Name *</label><input name="name" required></div><div class="field"><label>Email *</label><input name="email" type="email" required></div></div><div class="field"><label>Topic</label><select name="topic"><option>General enquiry</option><option>Correction request</option><option>News tip (we protect sources)</option><option>Press release</option><option>Advertising / sponsorship</option><option>Partnership</option><option>Careers counselling</option><option>Legal / rights</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Message *</label><textarea name="message" required></textarea></div>{hp()}<div class="field">{consent()}</div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" data-label="Send message">Send message</button>{status()}</form><p class="small muted" style="margin-top:12px">Prefer email? <a href="#" data-mail data-subject="Enquiry via DefenceIndia.com">Click here to email the desk</a>.</p></div><aside><div class="widget"><h3>Quick links</h3><ul style="padding-left:1.1em;margin:0"><li><a href="{R('counselling/')}">Free career counselling</a></li><li><a href="{R('vendor-enquiry/')}">Vendor / industry enquiry</a></li><li><a href="{R('advertise/')}">Advertise</a></li><li><a href="{R('join-us/')}">Write for us / jobs</a></li><li><a href="{R('support/')}">Support us</a></li></ul></div><div class="widget"><h3>Community</h3><div class="social" style="margin-top:8px"><a data-link="whatsappChannel" href="#" style="background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--text)">WhatsApp</a><a data-link="telegram" href="#" style="background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--text)">Telegram</a><a data-link="social.x" href="#" style="background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--text)">X</a><a data-link="youtube.channelUrl" href="#" style="background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--text)">YouTube</a></div></div>{ad('rect')}</aside></div></div>''')
    page("disclaimer/", "Disclaimer & Trademark Disclosure", "Independence, trademark, accuracy and content disclaimers for DefenceIndia.com.", f'''<div class="container"><div class="prose"><h1>Disclaimer &amp; Trademark Disclosure</h1><h2>Independence and non-affiliation</h2><p>DefenceIndia.com is an independent, privately operated website. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or connected to the Ministry of Defence (Government of India), the Indian Army, Indian Navy, Indian Air Force, Indian Coast Guard, the Central Armed Police Forces, the Union Public Service Commission, the Staff Selection Commission, any defence public-sector undertaking, or any other government body.</p><h2>Trademarks and names</h2><p>The phrase "Defence India" is used descriptively to identify the subject of this website — India's defence sector — and is not asserted as a registered trademark. Names of government bodies, forces, examinations, companies, products and platforms appearing on this site are the trademarks or service marks of their respective owners and are used solely for identification, reference, commentary and news reporting under the principles of fair use and nominative use. Official emblems, crests, flags and insignia are not reproduced as branding of this site. If any organisation using a similar name or mark believes this site creates confusion, please <a href="{CONTACT_URL}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">contact us</a>; we review such requests promptly and in good faith.</p><h2>Copyright</h2><p>Original articles, data compilations, tools and design are © DefenceIndia.com. Quoted material, statistics and images are credited to their sources where applicable. Content may be quoted with attribution and a link; bulk reproduction requires written permission. To report an infringement, use the contact page with the URL and details.</p><h2>Accuracy</h2><p>Exam dates, eligibility, pay figures, equipment specifications and procurement values are compiled from public notifications and reporting and may change or contain errors. They are indicative and not official. Always verify with the official notification or source before acting. We correct errors promptly — see the <a href="{R('editorial-policy/')}">editorial policy</a>.</p><h2>No professional advice</h2><p>Nothing on this site is career, legal, financial or investment advice. Articles discussing listed companies are informational; DefenceIndia.com is not a SEBI-registered adviser.</p><h2>Operational security</h2><p>We publish only openly available information and do not solicit or accept classified or restricted material.</p><h2>Third parties</h2><p>Advertisements, sponsored content (always labelled), affiliate links and external websites are the responsibility of their operators. Lead-generation forms share your details only with the partner relevant to your request, as described in the <a href="{R('privacy/')}">privacy policy</a>.</p></div></div>''')
    page("privacy/", "Privacy Policy", "How DefenceIndia.com collects, uses and protects your data, including forms, cookies, analytics and advertising.", f'''<div class="container"><div class="prose"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: 27 September 2026</p><h2>What we collect</h2><p>Information you submit through forms (name, contact details, qualification, company details and messages); technical data such as IP address, device and pages viewed via analytics; and cookie identifiers used for analytics and advertising.</p><h2>How we use it</h2><p>To respond to enquiries, deliver counselling callbacks and vendor services you request, send newsletters you subscribe to, run contests, improve the site and serve advertising. Counselling and vendor enquiries may be shared with the specific partner (coaching institute, mentor or industry contact) needed to fulfil your request. We do not sell personal data.</p><h2>Cookies and advertising</h2><p>We use Google Analytics and Google AdSense. Google and its partners use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to this or other websites. You may opt out of personalised advertising at <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener nofollow">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener nofollow">aboutads.info</a>. Affiliate links (e.g. Amazon Associates) may set cookies to attribute purchases.</p><h2>Form processing</h2><p>Forms are delivered via a third-party form relay service to our inbox over HTTPS. We retain submissions for as long as needed to serve the request and comply with law.</p><h2>Your rights</h2><p>You may request access, correction or deletion of your data, or unsubscribe at any time, via the <a href="{R('contact/')}">contact page</a>. We comply with India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, and honour GDPR requests from EU residents.</p><h2>Children</h2><p>Users under 18 should use the site with parental guidance; contest entries from minors require guardian consent.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>Updates are posted on this page with a revised date.</p></div></div>''')
    page("terms/", "Terms of Use", "Terms governing use of DefenceIndia.com, its tools, forms, contests and content.", f'''<div class="container"><div class="prose"><h1>Terms of Use</h1><p>By using DefenceIndia.com you agree to these terms.</p><h2>Content</h2><p>Content is for general information. We make no warranty of completeness or accuracy; see the <a href="{R('disclaimer/')}">disclaimer</a>. You may link to and quote our content with attribution.</p><h2>Tools</h2><p>Eligibility, salary, comparison and other calculators provide indicative results based on public data and stated assumptions; they are not official determinations.</p><h2>User submissions</h2><p>By submitting a form, article, photo or contest entry you confirm the content is yours, lawful and not classified or restricted, and you grant us a non-exclusive licence to publish it with credit where applicable.</p><h2>Contests</h2><p>Contests are open to residents of India unless stated; minors need guardian consent; one entry per person; prizes are non-transferable and subject to applicable tax; organiser decisions are final; void where prohibited.</p><h2>Advertising and sponsorship</h2><p>Sponsored content is labelled. Advertisers are responsible for their claims. Lead-generation partners must comply with applicable law and our anti-spam requirements.</p><h2>Prohibited use</h2><p>No scraping at scale, no interference with the site, no unlawful, defamatory or infringing submissions, and no attempts to obtain restricted information.</p><h2>Liability</h2><p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, DefenceIndia.com is not liable for any loss arising from use of the site or reliance on its content.</p><h2>Governing law</h2><p>These terms are governed by the laws of India; courts in India have exclusive jurisdiction.</p></div></div>''')
    page("editorial-policy/", "Editorial Policy & Corrections", "Standards for accuracy, sourcing, sponsored content labelling, corrections and operational security at DefenceIndia.com.", f'''<div class="container"><div class="prose"><h1>Editorial Policy</h1><h2>Accuracy and sourcing</h2><p>We rely on official releases (PIB, MoD, service HQs, UPSC/SSC notifications), primary documents, and reputable reporting. Figures are attributed; estimates are marked as such. Explainers carry a date and are refreshed when facts change.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>Advertisers and sponsors have no influence on editorial coverage. Sponsored content and affiliate links are labelled. Staff do not trade on non-public information about listed defence companies.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>Material errors are corrected in the article with a note. Submit a correction via the <a href="{R('contact/')}">contact page</a> with the URL and the correct information and source.</p><h2>Operational security</h2><p>We do not publish troop movements, exact deployments, or any restricted information, and we decline material that appears classified.</p><h2>Comments and community</h2><p>Discussion happens on our WhatsApp, Telegram and social channels under their rules; abuse, misinformation and OPSEC violations are removed.</p><h2>AI and tools</h2><p>Automated tools assist with research and drafting; every published claim is reviewed by a human editor.</p></div></div>''')
